Kind: password_reset_requested
Locale: en
From: <noreply@tanvo.test>
Reply-To: 
To: <user@hooli.test>
Cc: 
Bcc: 
Subject: Reset your Tanvo password

==== text
Hello

We heard that you lost your Tanvo password. Sorry about that! But don't worry! You can use the following button to reset your password:

Reset your password: https://app.tanvo.test/reset-password/reset-token

If you don't use this link within 30 minutes, it will expire. To get a new password reset link, visit: https://app.tanvo.test/forgot-password

Thanks,
The Tanvo Team

--
You're receiving this email because a password reset was requested for your account.

